flowchart TB
    Player[Player] --> Web[React Web Client]
    Web --> API[NestJS API]
    API --> Domain[Application and Domain Modules]
    Domain --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    API --> Queue[Redis / BullMQ]
    Queue --> Worker[Simulation Worker]
    Worker --> Engine[Simulation and Economic Engine]
    Engine --> DB
    Engine --> Events[Persisted Domain Events]
    Events --> Reports[Reports and Notifications]
    Reports --> Web
    AI[AI Company Policies] --> Engine
    Consumers[Aggregate Consumer Cohorts] --> Engine
    Government[Government and Banks] --> Engine
    Markets[Market and Trading Engine] --> Engine
